- What is the average pH, temperature, and turbidity at a given time?
- What is the maximum, minimum, and average value of a parameter over a given time interval?

Ontology Design Pattern (ODP):

```turtle
@prefix : <http://example.org/monitoring/>.
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>.
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>.
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>.
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>.
@prefix time: <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#>.

# Classes
:Station a owl:Class.
:Measurement a owl:Class.
:Parameter a owl:Class.

:Station rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty :locatedAt ;
                            owl:hasValue?location. ].

:Measurement rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty.
:Measurement rdfs:domain :Station.
:Measurement rdfs:range :MeasurementInstance.

:MeasurementInstance rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual.
:MeasurementInstance rdf:type owl:Class.

:Parameter rdfs:subClassOf owl:Thing.

:Parameter rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty.
:Parameter rdfs:domain :MeasurementInstance.
:Parameter rdfs:range owl:Thing.

:pH a :Parameter.
:temperature a :Parameter.
:turbidity a :Parameter.

:MeasurementInstance rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty.
:MeasurementInstance :hasTimestamp rdf:type xsd:dateTime.
:MeasurementInstance :hasUnit rdf:type xsd:string.

:hasTimestamp rdfs:domain :MeasurementInstance.
:hasTimestamp rdfs:range xsd:dateTime.

:hasUnit rdfs:domain :MeasurementInstance.
:hasUnit rdfs:range xsd:string.

# Requirement-to-axiom mapping:
1. Station: :Station
2. Measurement: :Measurement
3. Parameter: :Parameter
4. hasTimestamp: :hasTimestamp
5. hasUnit: :hasUnit

# CQ-to-axiom mapping:
CQ1: :Measurement :producedBy?station.
CQ2: :Measurement :observes?parameter.
CQ3: :MeasurementInstance :hasTimestamp?timestamp.
CQ3: :MeasurementInstance :hasUnit?unit.
CQ4:?average rdf:type av:Average ;
                      av:averageOf (?measurement1 :hasValue?pH1) (?measurement2 :hasValue?pH2)... ;
                      av:averageOf (?measurement1 :hasValue?temperature1) (?measurement2 :hasValue?temperature2)... ;
                      av:averageOf (?measurement1 :hasValue?turbidity1) (?measurement2 :hasValue?turbidity2)....
CQ5:?max rdf:type av:Max ;
         av:maxValue?maxValue.
CQ5:?min rdf:type av:Min ;
         av:minValue?minValue.
CQ5:?avg rdf:type av:Average ;
         av:averageOf (?measurement1 :hasValue